Source: rpz-pi
Section: net
Maintainer: Chris <clowder@hey.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2

Package: rpz-pi
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, unbound, dns-root-data, ca-certificates
Description: Lightweight ad-blocking DNS: Unbound + Hagezi RPZ blocklist
 Configures Unbound as the DNS resolver for your local network. It blocks
 domains on the Hagezi Light RPZ list, with a local allowlist for
 exceptions.
